计算反常积分:

(1) $\iint_D \frac{1}{\sqrt{x^2+y^2}} \,\mathrm{d} x \,\mathrm{d} y$, 其中 $D$ 是单位圆内部;
(2) $\iint_D \frac{\,\mathrm{d} x \,\mathrm{d} y}{(1+x+y)^\alpha}$, 其中 $D$ 是第一象限, $\alpha > 2$ 为常数;
(3) $\iint_D \max(x,y)\mathrm{e}^{-(x^2+y^2)} \,\mathrm{d} x \,\mathrm{d} y$, 其中 $D$ 是第一象限.

求 $F'(\alpha)$:

(1) $F(\alpha) = \int_{\sin\alpha}^{\cos\alpha} \mathrm{e}^{\alpha\sqrt{1-x^2}} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(2) $F(\alpha) = \int_{a+\alpha}^{b+\alpha} \frac{\sin\alpha x}{x} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(3) $F(\alpha) = \int_0^\alpha \frac{\ln(1+\alpha x)}{x} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(4) $F(\alpha) = \int_0^\alpha f(x+\alpha, x-\alpha) \,\mathrm{d} x \ (f(u,v) \text{ 有连续偏导数})$.

应用对参数进行微分或积分的方法, 计算下列积分:

(1) $\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{2}} \ln(a^2\sin^2 x+b^2\cos^2 x) \,\mathrm{d} x \ (a > 0, b > 0)$;
(2) $\int_0^\pi \ln(1-2a\cos x+a^2) \,\mathrm{d} x \ (0 \leqslant a < 1)$;
(3) $\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{2}} \frac{\arctan(a\tan x)}{\tan x} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (a \geqslant 0)$;
(4) $\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{2}} \ln\frac{1+a\cos x}{1-a\cos x} \cdot \frac{\,\mathrm{d} x}{\cos x} \ (0 \leqslant a < 1)$.

确定下列参变量反常积分的收敛域:

(1) $\int_0^{+\infty} x^u \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(2) $\int_1^{+\infty} x^u \frac{x+\sin x}{x-\sin x} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(3) $\int_2^{+\infty} \frac{\,\mathrm{d} x}{x^u\ln x}$;
(4) $\int_0^\pi \frac{\,\mathrm{d} x}{\sin^u x}$;
(5) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\sin^2 x}{x^\alpha(1+x)} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(6) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\ln(1+x^2)}{x^\alpha} \,\mathrm{d} x$.

研究下列积分在指定区间上的一致收敛性:

(1) $\int_{-\infty}^{+\infty} \frac{\cos ux}{1+x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (-\infty < u < +\infty)$;
(2) $\int_0^{+\infty} \mathrm{e}^{-\alpha x}\sin\beta x \,\mathrm{d} x, \ a) \ 0 < \alpha_0 \leqslant \alpha < +\infty; \ b) \ 0 < \alpha < +\infty.$
(3) $\int_0^{+\infty} \sqrt{\alpha}\mathrm{e}^{-\alpha x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (0 \leqslant \alpha < +\infty)$;
(4) $\int_1^{+\infty} \frac{\ln(1+x^2)}{x^\alpha} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (1 < \alpha < +\infty)$;
(5) $\int_1^{+\infty} \mathrm{e}^{-\alpha x} \frac{\cos x}{x^p} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (0 \leqslant \alpha < +\infty) \ (\text{其中 } p>0 \text{ 的常数})$;
(6) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\sin(x^2)}{1+x^p} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (0 \leqslant p < +\infty)$.

计算下列积分:

(1) $\int_0^1 \frac{x^\beta-x^\alpha}{\ln x} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (\alpha, \beta > -1)$;
(2) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{1-\mathrm{e}^{-\alpha x}}{x\mathrm{e}^x} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (\alpha > -1)$;
(3) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{1-\mathrm{e}^{-\alpha x^2}}{x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (\alpha > 0)$;
(4) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\mathrm{e}^{-\alpha x^2}-\mathrm{e}^{-\beta x^2}}{x} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (\alpha, \beta > 0)$;
(5) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\arctan\alpha x}{x(1+x^2)} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(6) $\int_0^{+\infty} \left[ \mathrm{e}^{-\left(\frac{a}{x}\right)^2} - \mathrm{e}^{-\left(\frac{b}{x}\right)^2} \right] \,\mathrm{d} x \ (0 < a < b)$.

利用 $\int_0^{+\infty} \mathrm{e}^{-x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x = \frac{\sqrt{\pi}}{2}$ 及 $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\sin x}{x} \,\mathrm{d} x = \frac{\pi}{2}$ 计算:

(1) $\int_{-\infty}^{+\infty} \frac{x}{\sigma\sqrt{2\pi}} \mathrm{e}^{-\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{x-a}{\sigma}\right)^2} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (\sigma > 0)$;
(2) $\int_{-\infty}^{+\infty} \frac{(x-a)^2}{\sigma\sqrt{2\pi}} \mathrm{e}^{-\frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{x-a}{\sigma}\right)^2} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (\sigma > 0)$;
(3) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\sin\alpha x\cos\beta x}{x} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (\alpha > 0, \beta > 0)$;
(4) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\sin^2 x}{x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(5) $\int_0^{+\infty} x^{2n}\mathrm{e}^{-x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (n \text{ 是正整数})$;
(6) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\sin^4 x}{x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x$.

steps:
(1) 作变量代换 $t = \frac{x-a}{\sigma}$, 则 $x = \sigma t + a, \,\mathrm{d} x = \sigma\,\mathrm{d} t$.
    $$\begin{aligned}
        \int_{-\infty}^{+\infty} \frac{\sigma t + a}{\sqrt{2\pi}} \mathrm{e}^{-\frac{t^2}{2}} \,\mathrm{d} t
        &= \frac{\sigma}{\sqrt{2\pi}}
        \int_{-\infty}^{+\infty} t\mathrm{e}^{-\frac{t^2}{2}} \,\mathrm{d} t \\
        &\quad + a \int_{-\infty}^{+\infty}
        \frac{1}{\sqrt{2\pi}}\mathrm{e}^{-\frac{t^2}{2}} \,\mathrm{d} t.
    \end{aligned}$$
    第一项的被积函数为奇函数，故积分为 $0$。

