证明:

(1) $\Gamma(s) = 2 \int_0^{+\infty} x^{2s-1}\mathrm{e}^{-x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (s > 0)$;
(2) $\Gamma(s) = a^s \int_0^{+\infty} x^{s-1}\mathrm{e}^{-ax} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (s > 0, a > 0)$.

利用 Euler 积分计算:

(1) $\int_0^1 \sqrt{x-x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(2) $\int_0^a x^2\sqrt{a^2-x^2} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(3) $\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{2}} \sin^6 x \cos^4 x \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(4) $\int_0^1 x^{n-1}(1-x^m)^{q-1} \,\mathrm{d} x \ (n,m,q > 0)$;
(5) $\int_0^{+\infty} \frac{\mathrm{e}^{-at}}{\sqrt{\pi t}} \,\mathrm{d} t \ (a > 0)$;
(6) $\int_0^{\frac{\pi}{2}} \tan^\alpha x \,\mathrm{d} x \ (|\alpha| < 1)$;
(7) $\int_0^1 \sqrt[n]{\frac{1}{x}-1} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(8) $\int_a^b \left(\frac{b-x}{x-a}\right)^p \,\mathrm{d} x \ (0 < p < 1)$;
(9) $\lim_{n\to\infty} \int_1^2 (x-1)^2 \cdot \sqrt[n]{\frac{2-x}{x-1}} \,\mathrm{d} x$;
(10) $\lim_{n\to\infty} \int_0^{+\infty} \frac{1}{1+x^n} \,\mathrm{d} x$.
